---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy · AutoDeck" description="What AutoDeck collects, why, and who sees it." page="privacy">
  <section class="phero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated 14 October 2026. This explains what the AutoDeck website and app collect and how we use it.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="s" style="padding-top:40px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;display:grid;gap:22px">
    <div><h3>What we collect</h3><p>Your name, phone number and Google sign-in details when you create an account. Your cars (make, model, registration number, size, photos you add). Your bookings, visit history, invoices, membership and notification preferences. Payment status from our payment provider. We do not see or store your card number.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Why we use it</h3><p>To book and run your visits, keep your car's service record, send updates about your car, issue invoices and take payment, and keep the studio safe and running. We do not sell your data.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Who sees it</h3><p>The AutoDeck studio team sees what they need to look after your car. Our payment provider (Razorpay) processes online payments. Our hosting and database providers (Google Firebase and Vercel) store and serve the data for us.</p></div>
    <div><h3>How long we keep it</h3><p>For as long as your account is open and for the period the law requires us to keep invoices and payment records.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your choices</h3><p>You can edit your profile and cars in the app. To correct or delete your data, message us on WhatsApp at <a class="link" href="tel:+919898679711">+91 98986 79711</a> and we will help.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Contact</h3><p>AutoDeck, Sunbeam Complex, Old Sharda Mandir Rd, Ellisbridge, Ahmedabad 380006.</p></div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
